# PETAL PARADE: saving 10 pups at once earns the Beacon (10+20+...+100).
game petalparade
wait 20
press A
cheat clear
cheat posy 0 5 0
cheat put pup 1 5
cheat put pup 2 5
cheat put pup 3 5
cheat put pup 4 5
cheat put pup 5 5
cheat put pup 6 5
cheat put pup 7 5
cheat put pup 8 5
cheat put pup 9 5
cheat put pup 10 5
cheat put pad 1 5
cheat put pad 2 5
cheat put pad 3 5
cheat put pad 4 5
cheat put pad 5 5
cheat put pad 6 5
cheat put pad 7 5
cheat put pad 8 5
cheat put pad 9 5
cheat put pad 10 5
wait 87
expect hx == 11
expect line == 10
press B
expect saved == 10
expect score == 550
expect goals & 1
expect goals !& 2
press DOWN
wait 3
expect state == 1
expect hy == 6
